---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/ProgramLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../../components/PageHero.astro';
import ProgramEnd from '../../../components/ProgramEnd.astro';
import Icon from '../../../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Layout track="space" section="career-preparation" title="Space technology portfolio & review preparation" description="Practise multidisciplinary design reviews, subsystem tradeoffs, telemetry debugging and technical demonstrations through space technology learning projects."><PageHero slot="hero" eyebrow="SPACE TECHNOLOGY / CAREER PREPARATION" title="Explain your part. Understand the whole." description="Practise the conversations that connect individual engineering work to a team outcome. Build a portfolio around decisions, tests and limitations." image="space-tech" imageAlt="AI-generated learning scene with learners collaborating; not actual academy participants" />
<section class="container section"><div class="three-grid">{[['Design reviews','Present a mission need, trace it to a requirement and defend a tradeoff with a calculation. Explain assumptions and questions that remain open.'],['Cross-discipline collaboration','Write an interface agreement another discipline can use. Explain units, timing, tolerances and fault behaviour without assuming shared jargon.'],['Incident walkthroughs','Investigate stale telemetry, an energy shortfall or a failed contact. Distinguish evidence from guesses and propose the next useful test.']].map(([title,copy])=><article class="feature"><span class="feature-icon"><Icon name="message" /></span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></article>)}</div></section><section class="container section two-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR PORTFOLIO CASE STUDY</p><h2>A mission story someone else can follow.</h2><p>Show the problem, your contribution, the interfaces you owned, a result that changed your design and the next test you would run. Credit team contributions clearly.</p><p>These exercises develop communication and engineering practice. They do not promise a space-industry position, research placement or agency recruitment.</p></div><article class="portfolio-check"><h3>Your review package</h3><ul class="check-list"><li>Mission brief and architecture diagram</li><li>Reproducible budgets and assumptions</li><li>Telemetry demo and fault-test evidence</li><li>Interface records and change history</li><li>Operations runbook and honest limitations</li></ul></article></section><ProgramEnd track="space" /></Layout>